.TH KIWIMATECODER 1 "" "kiwimatecoder 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kiwimatecoder \- agentic AI coding assistant CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kiwimatecoder
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ command-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
KiwiMateCoder is a terminal coding agent: it chats about a workspace, reads and edits files, runs shell commands, and can operate headlessly in scripts and CI. Run it with no arguments for an interactive session, or use a subcommand for one-shot and management tasks.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
