Force the debug telemetry level for one run.
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fP
Disable ANSI color output when set.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fP
Success.
.TP
\fB1\fP
Runtime failure (for example a missing API key or provider error).
.TP
\fB2\fP
